{"availability":"available","full":"q3learners/jev-demofast","name":"jev-demofast","description":"One sentence in, a product demo video out. Jev drives your real product in a browser; an index built from your source code guides it.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T12:03:36Z","updated":"2026-09-24T22:02:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://onecentdemo.com","topics":["browser-automation","cloudflare-workers-ai","demo-video","jev","nextjs","product-demo"],"demo":"https://onecentdemo.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:48:15.317Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:48:15.317Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:48:15.317Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:46.774Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:38:33.586Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:03:55.541Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T23:48:15.317Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One sentence in, a product demo video out. jev-demofast drives your real product in a browser, outlines every element it uses, and renders an MP4 or GIF, optionally narrated by a human-sounding voice. The step-by-step decisions are made by Jev, a fast \"System One\" decision model. On your own app, Jev is guided by a map of every screen built from your source code.","That GIF is the unedited output, about 20 seconds from sentence to video. Jev opened the hidden Date range menu to find \"This week\" on its own.","Hand-recorded demos go stale with every UI change, and every demo tool we could find starts with a person recording clicks. jev-demofast starts from a sentence, so re-recording after a release is one command."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/q3learners/jev-demofast/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5b68a0a4ecd9696df95ae5ca751d48ba2cb9b982edb0d4499e284a30832f2fab","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:46.884Z"},"ov